@@ -42,0 +43,11 @@
+`template_condition` is a bounded source witness. It lists enclosing `@if`,
+`@else`, `@for`, and `@empty` branches with their raw expressions and source
+locations, plus inherited `*ngIf`, `*ngFor`, or `[hidden]` attributes. Its
+branch delimiters are excluded from the source label used for ranking. Its
+`CONDITIONAL_SOURCE` status means these declarations contain the candidate;
+`NO_LOCAL_GUARD_FOUND` means this scan found no guard around it. Unsupported
+blocks or malformed nesting return `UNRESOLVED_CONTROL_FLOW` with parse issues.
+No status proves that a route was activated, an expression was true, a loop
+had items, an element was visible, or the rendered DOM contained the control.
+Confirm the route and state in a real scenario before those claims.
+
